  "totalBlocks": 26,
  "translatedBlocks": 26,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2fd6f810a7adce76",
      "translationZh": "我们最近一直在 huggingface.js 中开发 Agents.js。这是一个新库，可让你在浏览器或服务器端通过 JavaScript 为 LLMs 提供工具访问能力。它开箱即用地提供了几个多模态工具，也可以轻松通过你自己的工具和语言模型进行扩展。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c3fc54aa5390dc2c",
      "translationZh": "安装",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3217c04f65c1cb97",
      "translationZh": "入门非常简单，你可以通过以下方式从 npm 获取这个库：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "8d59829c1e15afe1",
      "translationZh": "使用方法",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "941821bb85d96279",
      "translationZh": "该库公开了 HfAgent 对象，它是这个库的入口。你可以像这样将其实例化：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a09916fa2a920b7c",
      "translationZh": "之后，使用这个智能体就很简单了。你给它一条纯文本命令，它就会返回一些消息。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ef9e8335a38e5374",
      "translationZh": "在这个例子中，它生成了以下代码",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b4bbcdf45a5a3872",
      "translationZh": "然后可以像这样执行代码：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e471e02944857c18",
      "translationZh": "智能体返回的消息是具有以下结构的对象：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "aee6dea351a86ea3",
      "translationZh": "其中，message 是提示文本，data 可以包含字符串或 blob。blob 可用于显示图像或播放音频。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fbec2b33808611b1",
      "translationZh": "如果你信任自己的环境（参见警告），也可以使用 run 直接运行根据提示生成的代码：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c9d5699297349db2",
      "translationZh": "使用警告",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cd23ec935e054f64",
      "translationZh": "目前，使用这个库意味着要在浏览器（或 Node）中执行任意代码。这存在安全风险，不应在不可信的环境中进行。我们建议你使用 generateCode 和 evaluateCode，而不是 run，以便检查自己正在运行的代码。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "1a3e950b2443b563",
      "translationZh": "自定义 LLM 💬",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9444e573b9c0725e",
      "translationZh": "默认情况下，HfAgent 会使用通过托管推理 API 提供的 OpenAssistant/oasst-sft-4-pythia-12b-epoch-3.5 作为 LLM。不过，这可以自定义。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3635332ada6db806",
      "translationZh": "实例化 HfAgent 时，你可以传入自定义的 LLM。在这里，LLM 可以是任何接受字符串输入并返回字符串 promise 的异步函数。例如，如果你有 OpenAI API 密钥，就可以像这样使用它：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "8f66391c3d007db3",
      "translationZh": "自定义工具 🛠️",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a80e61ab82bdbed9",
      "translationZh": "Agents.js 的设计便于通过自定义工具和示例进行扩展。例如，如果你想添加一个将文本从英语翻译成德语的工具，可以这样做：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b301270a0944afc9",
      "translationZh": "现在，在初始化智能体时，就可以将这个工具添加到工具列表中。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "9fb6f038a205805c",
      "translationZh": "向智能体传入输入文件 🖼️",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7649e9d185566c24",
      "translationZh": "智能体也可以接收输入文件，并将其传递给工具。你可以向 generateCode 和 evaluateCode 传入一个可选的 FileList，如下所示：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d69d73da3fa8a5f2",
      "translationZh": "如果你有以下 html：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8831caa1b151603e",
      "translationZh": "那么你可以这样做：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "68f6305261eebe89",
      "translationZh": "传入一张图片后，便生成了以下代码：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "7021d90a98e2ed6a",
      "translationZh": "演示 🎉",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4152c97f544c5d0d",
      "translationZh": "我们一直在为 Agents.js 开发一个演示，你可以在这里试用。它由我们在 HuggingChat 上使用的同一款 Open Assistant 30B 模型驱动，并使用从 hub 调用的工具。🚀",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
